'''Feathergeddon: Swan Song (Brutal) ''' is the fourth and final stage in [[Invasion of Poultrio]]. This [[No Continues]] stage is guaranteed to drop [[Paperboy Cat (Rare Cat)|Paperboy Cat]] when cleared for the first time.

